---

## Changelog

- **v2.3** — Conversation Qdrant now stores `dense + sparse` (was dense only). Diagram 01 conversation retrieval pipeline now matches document pipeline: Stage 1 recall → Stage 2 RRF fusion → Stage 3 BGE re-rank → Stage 4 composite scoring. Diagram 03 has new dual-embedding worker. Diagram 02 schemas updated.
- **v2.2** — Access boundary made structural. Document stores MCP-only; conversation stores direct. Document chunk schema enriched (heading_prefix, doc_title, author, doc_type, language, topic_tags). Diagram 05 split into Track A (retrieval) and Track B (knowledge).
- **v2.1** — Importance scoring + recency + usage signals + daily decay job.
- **v2.0** — MCP architecture, dual-mode retrieval, tool registry (Diagram 06).
- **v1.x** — Initial diagrams, framework removal.
